From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 093/191] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the rail's
 context loading: fresh reads past the runner cache, real pending reasons,
 retries only for pending

A turn end, Refresh and Try again now read with fresh=true, which the route forwards and the runner uses to skip its three-minute snapshot cache, so a turn's new context replaces the pre-turn snapshot. Pending answers carry the actual not-ready reason, shown once the quiet window ends, and a spent window is not reopened by the automatic reload, only by a status change, Refresh or Try again. Only pending answers retry quietly; a plain unavailable answer shows at once. The last watcher leaving an entry clears pending with its retry state.
